  "loc": "Abstract, p. 370",
  "quote": "we study the complexity of deciding whether voters\u2019 preferences can be explained",
  "note": "The main object is recognising whether a preference profile can be partitioned into k structured subprofiles (single-peaked, group-separable, value-restricted, caterpillar group-separable), plus forbidden-minor characterisations of preference domains. No aggregation procedure or voting rule is studied, and no strategic or computational aspect of one; voting rules such as Chamberlin\u2013Courant appear only as motivation in the introduction (p. 371). Coding stopped per C0."
